{"id":"h-0401","domain":"kids chore chart","names":["Dishes","Laundry","Trash","Reward"],"text":"Okay so the chore chart for the kids needs a rethink, because the dishes always get skipped. Move Dishes above Laundry so it gets done first. Make the Reward a large gold star so the kids know it matters. Which chore is the bottommost one now? And how many connections does Trash have?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Dishes","position":"above","anchor":"Laundry"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Reward","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Reward","color":"gold"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Reward","shape":"star"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"bottommost"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Trash"}}]}
{"id":"h-0402","domain":"EV charging network","names":["Station1","Station2","Grid4","Solar3"],"text":"I am mapping the charging network for the new depot, and the station layout is messy. Connect Station1 to Grid4 with a solid arrow, then connect Station2 to Grid4 with a dashed arrow labeled backup. Make Solar3 a teal hexagon, because it feeds the grid directly. Is Station2 reachable from Solar3? Which shape has the fewest connections?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Station1","to":"Grid4"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Station2","to":"Grid4","style":"dashed","label":"backup"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Solar3","color":"teal"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Solar3","shape":"hexagon"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"path","from":"Solar3","to":"Station2"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"leastConnected"}}]}
{"id":"h-0403","domain":"car wash flow","names":["Entry3","Wash","Dry","Exit3"],"text":"Our car wash line keeps jamming near the dryer, so please move Dry to the right of Wash. Connect Entry3 to Wash with a plain arrow, and Wash to Dry with a dashed arrow. Make Exit3 a tiny red square so drivers know to stop. Which shape is the rightmost? And is Exit3 connected to Dry?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Dry","position":"rightOf","anchor":"Wash"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Entry3","to":"Wash"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Wash","to":"Dry","style":"dashed"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Exit3","size":"tiny"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Exit3","color":"red"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Exit3","shape":"square"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"rightmost"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"connected","target":"Exit3","anchor":"Dry"}}]}
{"id":"h-0404","domain":"airline crew schedule","names":["Crew1","Crew2","Flight","Layover"],"text":"For the airline crew schedule, the layover should sit between Crew1 and Crew2, so please move Layover between them. Connect Flight to Crew1 with a plain line, and Flight to Crew2 with a dotted line. Make Flight a large navy oval. How many connections does Flight have now? Which shape is the leftmost one?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Layover","position":"between","anchor":"Crew1,Crew2"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Flight","to":"Crew1","arrow":"none"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Flight","to":"Crew2","style":"dotted"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Flight","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Flight","color":"navy"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Flight","shape":"ellipse"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Flight"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"leftmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0405","domain":"marathon route","names":["Start5","Mile10","Finish5","Water"],"text":"For the marathon route map, we need the water stop halfway, so move Water to the right of Mile10. Please connect Start5 to Mile10 with an arrow labeled first half, and Mile10 to Finish5 labeled second half. Make Finish5 a huge green star for the finish line. Is Water reachable from Start5? And which point is the rightmost?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Water","position":"rightOf","anchor":"Mile10"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Start5","to":"Mile10","label":"first half"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Mile10","to":"Finish5","label":"second half"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Finish5","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Finish5","color":"green"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Finish5","shape":"star"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"path","from":"Start5","to":"Water"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"rightmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0406","domain":"student council election","names":["Nominee","Vote","Count","Winner"],"text":"Our student council election needs a simple flow. Connect Nominee to Vote with a plain arrow, then Vote to Count labeled tally. Please move Winner below Count. Which shapes are not blue right now? Also, is Winner connected to Nominee?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Nominee","to":"Vote"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Vote","to":"Count","label":"tally"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Winner","position":"below","anchor":"Count"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"list","notColor":"blue"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"connected","target":"Winner","anchor":"Nominee"}}]}
{"id":"h-0407","domain":"TV remote screen design","names":["Power","Volume","Channel","Menu2"],"text":"Let's redo the remote control screen. Move Volume to the left of Channel, since thumbs reach the left side first. Make Power a small red circle and put Menu2 below Channel. Which buttons are not red right now? Also, is Volume connected to Power?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Volume","position":"leftOf","anchor":"Channel"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Power","size":"small"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Power","color":"red"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Power","shape":"circle"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Menu2","position":"below","anchor":"Channel"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"list","notColor":"red"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"connected","target":"Volume","anchor":"Power"}}]}
{"id":"h-0408","domain":"scooter rental app states","names":["Locked2","Unlocked2","Riding","Parked"],"text":"The scooter app flow has bugs, so connect Locked2 to Unlocked2 with an arrow labeled scan, and then Unlocked2 to Riding labeled start. Connect Riding to Parked with a dashed line. Make Parked a navy diamond because it is the final state. Is Locked2 reachable from Parked? How many arrows leave Riding?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Locked2","to":"Unlocked2","label":"scan"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Unlocked2","to":"Riding","label":"start"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Riding","to":"Parked","style":"dashed"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Parked","color":"navy"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Parked","shape":"diamond"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"path","from":"Parked","to":"Locked2"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Riding"}}]}
{"id":"h-0409","domain":"wallet onboarding draft","names":["Seed","Backup","Verify","Wallet"],"text":"For the wallet onboarding draft, connect Seed to Backup with a plain arrow, because the seed must be saved first. Then connect Backup to Verify and Verify to Wallet, both with plain arrows. Make Wallet a large teal circle. Which step is the topmost? Also, what is the degree of Verify?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Seed,Backup,Verify,Wallet","pairing":"chain"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Wallet","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Wallet","color":"teal"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Wallet","shape":"circle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"topmost"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Verify"}}]}
{"id":"h-0410","domain":"achievement tree design","names":["Novice","Adept","Master","Legend"],"text":"The achievement tree is too flat, so put Adept below Novice and Master below Adept. Make Legend a huge gold star at the top of the page. Which achievement is the leftmost? And how many connections does Master have?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Adept","position":"below","anchor":"Novice"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Master","position":"below","anchor":"Adept"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Legend","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Legend","color":"gold"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Legend","shape":"star"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Legend","position":"top"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"leftmost"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Master"}}]}
{"id":"h-0411","domain":"cell cycle diagram","names":["G1","S","G2","Mitosis"],"text":"For the cell cycle diagram, connect G1 to S with an arrow, then S to G2 with an arrow, and G2 to Mitosis with a dashed arrow labeled divide. Make Mitosis a purple oval, since that is the final phase. Is G1 reachable from Mitosis? Which phase is the rightmost one?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"G1,S,G2","pairing":"chain"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"G2","to":"Mitosis","style":"dashed","label":"divide"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Mitosis","color":"purple"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Mitosis","shape":"ellipse"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"path","from":"Mitosis","to":"G1"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"rightmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0412","domain":"shared apartment laundry","names":["Wash2","Dryer","Fold2","Closet"],"text":"So laundry day is chaos again. Put Dryer to the right of Wash2, so you do not carry wet clothes far. Connect Wash2 to Dryer with a plain arrow and make Fold2 a small green square. Which shapes are not green? Also, how many connections does Closet have?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Dryer","position":"rightOf","anchor":"Wash2"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Wash2","to":"Dryer"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Fold2","size":"small"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Fold2","color":"green"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Fold2","shape":"square"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"list","notColor":"green"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Closet"}}]}
{"id":"h-0413","domain":"ticket sales states","names":["Available","Reserved","Paid","Refunded"],"text":"Ticket states need a clearer map for the event site. Connect Available to Reserved with an arrow labeled hold, then Reserved to Paid labeled pay. Connect Paid to Refunded with a dotted line labeled cancel, and make Refunded a gray hexagon. Which states are not gray? And is Refunded reachable from Available?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Available","to":"Reserved","label":"hold"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Reserved","to":"Paid","label":"pay"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Paid","to":"Refunded","style":"dotted","label":"cancel"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Refunded","color":"gray"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Refunded","shape":"hexagon"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"list","notColor":"gray"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"path","from":"Available","to":"Refunded"}}]}
{"id":"h-0414","domain":"salon booking board","names":["Booking","Stylist","Wash3","Chair"],"text":"Our salon booking board is a mess, so move Stylist above Chair and place Wash3 below Booking. Please connect Booking to Stylist with a plain arrow. Make the Chair a huge blue rectangle. How many connections does Stylist have? Which shape is the leftmost one?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Stylist","position":"above","anchor":"Chair"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Wash3","position":"below","anchor":"Booking"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Booking","to":"Stylist"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Chair","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Chair","color":"blue"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Chair","shape":"rectangle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Stylist"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"leftmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0415","domain":"resort map for travel agent","names":["Beach","Pool4","Bar4","Hotel"],"text":"For the resort map, the Hotel should sit behind the beach, so move Hotel above Beach. Connect Pool4 to Bar4 with a plain line, and Bar4 to Beach with a dotted line. Make Pool4 a large cyan oval. Which shape is closest to Hotel? And is Beach bigger than Bar4?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Hotel","position":"above","anchor":"Beach"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Pool4","to":"Bar4","arrow":"none"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Bar4","to":"Beach","style":"dotted"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Pool4","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Pool4","color":"cyan"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Pool4","shape":"ellipse"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"nearest","anchor":"Hotel","superlative":"closest"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"check","target":"Beach","comparison":"bigger","anchor":"Bar4"}}]}
{"id":"h-0416","domain":"pottery studio workflow","names":["Wedge","Throw","Trim","Glaze","Fire"],"text":"My pottery studio has a clear order: wedge, throw, trim, glaze, then fire. Connect Wedge to Throw with a plain arrow and Throw to Trim with another. Connect Trim to Glaze with a plain arrow, then Glaze to Fire with a dashed arrow labeled kiln. Make Fire a huge orange hexagon. Which step is the bottommost?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Wedge,Throw,Trim,Glaze","pairing":"chain"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Glaze","to":"Fire","style":"dashed","label":"kiln"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Fire","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Fire","color":"orange"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Fire","shape":"hexagon"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"bottommost"}}]}
