{"id":"h-0418","domain":"studio signal chain","names":["Mic","Preamp","Comp","Speakers"],"text":"Signal chain check for the studio, uh, mic into preamp, then compressor, then monitors. Connect Mic to Preamp with a plain arrow, Preamp to Comp with a plain arrow, and Comp to Speakers with a dashed arrow labeled monitor. Make Comp a teal hexagon. Which device is the rightmost in the diagram? Is Speakers connected to Mic at all?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Mic,Preamp,Comp","pairing":"chain"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Comp","to":"Speakers","style":"dashed","label":"monitor"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Comp","color":"teal"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Comp","shape":"hexagon"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"rightmost"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"connected","target":"Speakers","anchor":"Mic"}}]}
